Review the following Java banking transfer implementation for race conditions, deadlock vulnerabilities, and adherence to market readiness standards.

```
public void transfer(Account from, Account to, BigDecimal amount) {
    synchronized(from) {
        synchronized(to) {
            from.debit(amount);
            to.credit(amount);
        }
    }
}
```

Evaluate the following database query method in a Java repository for SQL injection vulnerabilities and specify exact remediation.

```
public ResultSet getAccountRecord(Connection conn, String userIban) throws SQLException {
    Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();
    String query = "SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE iban = '" + userIban + "' AND active = 1";
    return stmt.executeQuery(query);
}
```

